BT 1 0 0 1 0 96.5 Tm /F2 11.5 Tf 18 TL 1.828515 Tw (The internet has made computers even more useful. People can communicate instantly through) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.965245 Tw (email, messaging and video calls, access information from around the world and use online) Tj T* 0 Tw .384822 Tw (services. Cloud computing allows data and applications to be accessed through the internet instead) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.840834 Tw (of being stored only on one device. Artificial intelligence is another major development of the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.353182 Tw (present era. AI systems can recognize patterns, understand language, generate content and assist) Tj T* 0 Tw (people with many different tasks.) Tj T* ET
