BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm /F2 11.5 Tf 18 TL .999629 Tw (The future of computers is likely to involve greater speed, automation and intelligence. Artificial) Tj T* 0 Tw .146445 Tw (intelligence and machine learning are expected to become more capable and useful in areas such as) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.413471 Tw (education, medicine, science, transportation and business. Computers may be able to understand) Tj T* 0 Tw (human instructions more naturally and work together with people on increasingly complex tasks.) Tj T* ET
