BT 1 0 0 1 0 78.5 Tm /F2 11.5 Tf 18 TL .076335 Tw (Another important area is quantum computing. Unlike ordinary computers, quantum computers use) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.47612 Tw (principles of quantum mechanics to process information in a different way. They are still being) Tj T* 0 Tw .973679 Tw (developed, but in the future they may help solve certain problems that are extremely difficult for) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.11211 Tw (conventional computers. They could have applications in areas such as scientific research, materials) Tj T* 0 Tw (development, optimization and cryptography.) Tj T* ET
