BT 1 0 0 1 0 96.5 Tm /F2 11.5 Tf 18 TL .80236 Tw (Future computers may also become more connected with the physical world. Smart homes, smart) Tj T* 0 Tw 4.955471 Tw (cities, robots, wearable devices and autonomous systems could use computers to collect) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.994744 Tw (information and make decisions. New forms of human-computer interaction may also develop,) Tj T* 0 Tw 4.341706 Tw (including voice, gestures and other interfaces. At the same time, issues such as privacy,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.121706 Tw (cybersecurity, responsible use of artificial intelligence and the impact of automation on jobs will) Tj T* 0 Tw (become increasingly important.) Tj T* ET
