BT 1 0 0 1 0 96.5 Tm /F2 11.5 Tf 18 TL 3.126971 Tw (The development of computers shows how quickly technology can change. Computers have) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.180406 Tw (progressed from simple calculating tools and huge machines to powerful devices that are part of) Tj T* 0 Tw .450977 Tw (everyday life. In the present, they help people communicate, learn, work and solve problems more) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.008975 Tw (efficiently. In the future, computers are likely to become even more intelligent, connected and) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.493598 Tw (capable. However, their development should be guided by responsible use so that technology) Tj T* 0 Tw (continues to benefit society.) Tj T* ET
